<title>USA: PSC Inc settles suit against Metrologic.</title>
<headline>PSC Inc settles suit against Metrologic.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSC Inc said Wednesday it settled its suit against Metrologic Instruments Inc for infringement of one of its patents relating to bar code scanners.</p>
<p>The company said that in apparent response to PSC's suit, Metrologic redesigned its MS900 series product to avoid infringing on the PSC patent and has, therfore, decided not to press the suit further.</p>
<p>PSC makes laser based handheld and fixed position bar code scanners, bar code engines and verifiers and automated carton dimensioning systems.</p>
</text>
